WEBVTT

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:10.400
Saint Seiya

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:26.980
The Moment of Vacillation

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:34.650
Move, leg. Listen to me.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:41.330
Now I feel the damage I took from Papillon.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:44.250
Miss Saori.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:58.030
Miss Saori, no one holds a grudge against
Athena who gave us the strength to fight.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:02.810
I will, we will fight
until our Cosmo burn out.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.100
We want to fight, so.

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:06.460
Seiya.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:11.050
Seiya.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:12.320
Seiya.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.720
Wake up, Seiya.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:14.690
Seiya.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:15.490
Seiya.

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:18.190
Are you all right, Seiya?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.840
Shun, Hyoga, you came for me.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.460
Seiya, Mu's not with you?

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:29.820
Damn it. The true Specters have
infiltrated the twelve houses.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:31.090
Seiya.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.150
What?

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.170
If you act in haste, you'll trip again.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.730
Let's go. Aioria is waiting in the Leo house.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.140
Yeah.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:58.530
Leo Aioria, where are Saga and the others?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.820
Saga and the others?

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:06.880
I heard the traitors Saga, Camus
and Shura passed through here.

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:07.820
No clue.

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:14.520
Do you think I would let the enemy pass?

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:22.630
Then they have teleported to another house.

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:23.760
That's impossible.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:24.260
What?

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:31.050
Even psychokinetic Mu can't
teleport past a house.

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:38.410
Since ancient times, these twelve houses
have embodied the Cosmo of Athena.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.500
Even those with extraordinary mental powers.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:47.080
Need to walk through the twelve
houses on their two feet.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:52.040
If that's true, then where
are Saga and the others?

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:55.420
Are you that concerned about them?

00:05:55.650 --> 00:06:00.630
We Specters have never
trusted Saga and the others.

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:06.210
We can't lose sight of them
until they take Athena's head.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:10.140
I see. You guys are watchdogs.

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:15.430
That's right. And if Saga fails,
we'll take Athena's head ourselves!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:16.930
Now, move aside!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.580
How noble.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:24.660
However do you think I would
give up the Leo house so easily?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.190
There's just one of you!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:41.110
Listen to the Leo's roar!

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:44.050
Lightning Plasma!

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:13.800
What was that attack?

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:17.320
To take down five Specters at once.

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:23.300
I warned you. I will not let any
enemy pass through the Leo house.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:26.670
If you want to pass, do so once
you've prepared for death.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.530
He's on another level.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:32.210
Leo Aioria.

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:37.270
He is the golden lion baring its fangs.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:45.020
If we attack him straight on, he'll
get us with the lightning again.

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.670
Worst case, we'll all die.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:55.570
Why are you guys flustered by one Saint?

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:57.460
You are?

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:02.600
Worm Raimi.

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:14.460
In my hands, even the Lion
is just another pussy cat.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.050
I see the Leo house.

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.440
We're almost there.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:33.930
There's something there.

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:39.320
Hyoga.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:41.710
Yes, Specter corpses.

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:45.000
But why are their faces frozen in terror?

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:46.420
Over there too.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:49.510
Three Specters at once.

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:54.690
There's no sign of resistance. They
must have been killed at once.

00:08:55.020 --> 00:09:00.120
Seiya, don't you think it's
strange? These Specters are bare.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.970
Right, they don't have their Surplices on.

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.940
That's right. And this Specter...

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:09.460
Looks like he was frozen to death.

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:13.860
Could it be?

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:19.960
Their wounds look like they've
been caused by a sharp blade.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.330
It can't be.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:26.580
Seiya.
Seiya.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:28.250
Hmm.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:31.270
This corpse looks like it's been

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:33.790
thrashed around by tremendous force.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.260
Seiya?

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:47.460
Let's go, there's no point hanging
around. The answer is beyond here.

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:49.730
Wait, Seiya.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:55.300
Don't you get it? The one who defeated the
three Specters and took their Surplices...

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:59.360
Seiya's right. There's no
use just thinking about it.

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:05.040
That's right. We need to get
to Athena as soon as possible.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:07.610
Shun, hurry up.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:09.690
Fine.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:22.790
I'll take care of Aioria, you guys go ahead.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:32.390
He already went underground. Let's
leave this to Raimi and move on!

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:33.930
Yes!

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:35.950
Come on!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.820
What's this Cosmo?

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:46.480
I feel a Cosmo I've felt
before from the Specters.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:50.900
Plus, it's nostalgic.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.200
What's going on?

00:10:54.850 --> 00:11:00.720
Could it be there is someone
I know amongst the Specters?

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:10.980
Whatever! All who try to pass
are enemies, I'll kill them all!

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.950
You deserve it, Aioria.

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.620
Looks like you can't move.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:34.870
I'll show you mercy by killing you
before your body is torn into pieces.

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.300
Die!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:44.350
Don't cut in, I said I'd kill him myself.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.690
Now, you guys go ahead.

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:51.700
Fine. A Gold Saint is no match for you.

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:58.380
If that Cosmo belongs to
them, I can't let them pass.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:00.380
Wait!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:08.950
It's no use. Even a golden lion can't
break free from the Worm's Bind.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:14.540
I would love to suffocate you
to death but I have no time.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.860
I'll let you go easily.

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:17.500
What?

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.240
I'll smash your head!

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:29.490
You said you were Raimi?

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:35.120
Do you think I'd be done
in like a worm like you?

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:38.080
I'll show you the power of Leo.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:48.370
It's no use, you can't
escape the Worm's Bind.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.460
It can't be.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:13:00.880
I told you, a worm can't defeat a lion.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:05.120
I'll smash your head this time!

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:19.090
I have no time to entertain you.

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:24.920
I'll finish this by Leo's
fang, the Lightning Bolt!

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:42.080
Damn you. It's not over just
because you tore off the worms.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:45.090
I'll get you this time.

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:50.000
Die, Aioria! Worm's Bind!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.650
Even if I was distracted by those Cosmo,

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:26.510
I shouldn't have let the worms get me.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.030
Aioria!

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.180
You guys.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.910
What about the Specters?

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:37.300
I took down six, but a few of
them went to the Virgo house.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:38.880
The Virgo house?

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.650
Aioria, even at your level.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:46.430
I'm sorry, I was distracted
by a peculiar Cosmo.

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:48.280
Peculiar Cosmo?

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:52.720
Right. Amongst the Specters
headed to the Virgo house

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:56.250
there's someone we know.

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.230
What?

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:58.540
I thought so.

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:00.380
You knew?

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:06.670
I wasn't sure, but we saw three
Specter corpses on the way here.

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:13.850
Looking how they were killed,
it was definitely those three.

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:15.250
Those three?

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:21.900
Their motive for passing the
twelve houses is unclear.

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:25.520
But those three Cosmo are definitely theirs.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.360
You mean?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.360
Could it be?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.950
One.

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:44.850
This is the sixth Virgo
house. But I feel no Cosmo.

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:46.750
Two.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:49.490
It's empty.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:56.140
It's supposedly guarded by the
Gold Saint closest to God.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.810
Three.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:04.310
That means Saga and the others
clashed Cosmo with Shaka.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.070
And annihilated one another.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.600
Four.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:13.950
Either way, we'll save some
time if we don't have to fight.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.370
Let's advance to the next house.

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:18.110
Five.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:21.760
Rhadamanthys is losing patience.

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:23.570
We must hurry.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.370
Six.

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.590
What's this Cosmo?

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:32.780
That's true.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:34.020
Who's doing this?

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:41.300
The truth is infinitely deep and wonderful.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.520
Unfortunately.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:49.530
Even after tens of millions of years.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:53.290
It's hard for people to achieve the truth.

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:58.910
But you have been given the
chance to know the truth.

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:02.280
This is?

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.160
If possible.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:09.580
Learn love and justice of the
world, and rid yourselves of evil.

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:14.550
You've miraculously made it
to the Virgo house, Specters.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:20.390
Let me bless with parting
words. Go straight to hell!

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:24.070
Damn, you were alive!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.710
Virgo Shaka.

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:31.040
You bless us?

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:36.030
Delusional! What can you do by yourself?

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.110
We'll be the ones to bless you!

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:41.000
Die, Shaka!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.420
Khan!

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:49.160
What?

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:51.060
What's that defensive force?

00:17:55.280 --> 00:18:01.600
I see. After clashing with Saga,
he hid his Cosmo within the shield.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.010
He concealed his presence.

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.780
Exorcise the evil.

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:19.320
That is?

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:21.530
Heaven Supremacy!

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:39.640
You Specters and these evil
spirits are one and the same.

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:41.970
Nothing to be afraid of.

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:53.040
Is this an illusion, or...

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.570
I'll tell you one thing before you die.

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:59.860
If there are 108 Specters.

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:03.310
There are 108 beads.

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:11.300
These beads were created by Buddha
to eradicate evil like you.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.080
Poverty

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:14.820
Every time I turn a bead,
Poverty

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:18.750
an evil is expelled, along with a Specter.
Poverty

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:18.760
Anger
an evil is expelled, along with a Specter.
Poverty

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.000
an evil is expelled, along with a Specter.
Anger

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:21.270
Anger

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:28.620
Look, out of the 108 beads,
11 have turned color.

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:32.980
These are the fallen Specters who
have entered the twelve houses.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:36.710
What? Five died in the Leo house.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:41.690
And then... Could it be
Worm, Deep and Papillon?

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:44.950
Wait, which three were killed?

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:50.820
It doesn't add up, there's
only eight. Could it be?

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:52.500
It doesn't matter how many.

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:58.420
Soon I will take care of all the Specters.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:04.760
Now, the same number of beads as
there are you will turn color.

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:20.240
Evil beasts, don't hesitate to die!

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:24.860
Heaven Supremacy!

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:49.010
What?

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:53.940
Shaka's Heaven Supremacy disappeared.

00:20:55.610 --> 00:20:57.140
Who was it?

00:20:58.980 --> 00:20:59.960
Cube!

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.860
You're the one who stopped my attack.

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:10.620
Your empty threats don't intimidate us all.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:27.590
I see. His Cosmo vanished
once in the Cancer house.

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:30.680
You made it all the way here without dying.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.140
Now, Shaka, move out of the way.

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:34.400
Fool!

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:37.920
If you want to pass, it
will be over my dead body.

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.340
I'm game!

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:43.820
Ochs!

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:44.820
Mills.

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:46.630
We'll have you die.

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:47.530
Shaka.

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:50.300
Those other two are...

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:55.330
The sacred sword that cuts through anything.

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:58.050
Take this! Excalibur!

00:21:59.590 --> 00:22:02.970
The shine of absolute zero
that freezes everything.

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:07.010
Diamond Dust!

00:22:07.370 --> 00:22:11.380
Die besides the beautiful
stars of the galaxy!

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:14.810
Galaxian Explosion!

00:22:16.260 --> 00:22:17.720
What is that attack?

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:20.820
No, those three are different people.

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:22.400
Who are they?

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:26.410
Anyway, Shaka will die by their attack.

00:22:28.050 --> 00:22:29.420
Khan!

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:33.410
It's no use.

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:37.080
We can't do anything as
long as he has that shield.

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:39.250
No, not exactly.

00:22:49.390 --> 00:22:52.050
I can't be defeated like this.

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:09.840
Canon.

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:21.650
Aioria.

00:23:23.240 --> 00:23:27.060
The Cosmo I feel, belong to those three.

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:30.360
Right. And...

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:39.200
What?

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:42.580
Impossible! He's unscathed
after the barrage of attacks.

00:23:42.940 --> 00:23:44.470
We're not strong enough.

00:23:44.470 --> 00:23:45.110
Wait.

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:48.070
He's slightly wounded.

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:51.860
Slightly.

00:23:56.790 --> 00:24:00.750
You may be tainted by evil,
you are still Gold Saints.

00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:05.580
Can't ignore the strength of three combined.

00:24:05.990 --> 00:24:08.220
What, Gold Saints?

00:24:08.360 --> 00:24:10.420
Can it be, those three are?

00:24:16.190 --> 00:24:22.070
Now, take off those borrowed
Surplices and show your faces.

00:24:36.840 --> 00:24:38.240
You are? You are?

00:24:39.300 --> 00:24:41.040
Shaka is prepared to die.

00:24:42.160 --> 00:24:42.890
What?

00:24:43.070 --> 00:24:46.500
What do you mean he's
prepared to die, Aioria?

00:24:47.210 --> 00:24:53.310
Shaka wanted to stop those
three in the Cancer house.

00:24:54.030 --> 00:24:54.470
However.

00:24:55.450 --> 00:24:56.420
However?

00:24:57.240 --> 00:25:02.200
But their confrontation
happened in the Virgo house.

00:25:03.480 --> 00:25:05.710
Shaka is ready for death.

00:25:06.130 --> 00:25:08.320
I can't help but feel it.

00:25:10.100 --> 00:25:11.270
No way.

00:25:13.130 --> 00:25:14.190
Shaka.

00:25:17.970 --> 00:25:19.160
Shura.

00:25:22.240 --> 00:25:23.460
Camus.

00:25:27.080 --> 00:25:28.230
Saga.

00:26:55.490 --> 00:26:56.760
"We will kill Athena."

00:26:57.520 --> 00:26:59.680
The shocking declaration by Saga and the others

00:26:59.680 --> 00:27:01.600
crushes Shaka's doubts.

00:27:02.380 --> 00:27:03.980
His only choice now is to fight.

00:27:04.860 --> 00:27:07.260
The epic clash between Gold Saints

00:27:07.260 --> 00:27:10.190
leads to the unleashing of the forbidden shadow technique!

00:27:10.740 --> 00:27:14.950
Saint Seiya, "The End of Restraint" and "The Golden Clash."

00:27:15.590 --> 00:27:18.530
Do you sense the Cosmo?
